cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "PRU PPS: nanosecond-precision GPS Stratum 1 timekeeping on the BeagleBone Black"
abstract: >-
  BeagleBone Black PRU-based GPS pulse-per-second hardware timestamping feeding chrony
  via shared memory, achieving low-nanosecond clock offsets by bypassing the Linux GPIO
  interrupt path, with PTP cross-validation against an independent GPS grandmaster.
type: software
authors:
  - name: dniminenn
repository-code: "https://github.com/dniminenn/bbs-pps-pru"
url: "https://github.com/dniminenn/bbs-pps-pru"
license: MIT-0
keywords:
  - NTP
  - PTP
  - GPS
  - PPS
  - "stratum 1"
  - "BeagleBone Black"
  - PRU
  - chrony
  - "hardware timestamping"
  - timekeeping
